  // Mortar: a shell lobbed at 65..50 degrees with a charge that
  // sets its reach on the flat, linear in the barrel pitch (barrel down
  // 20 m, up 150 m; raising the barrel reaches further), heavy gravity so
  // it comes down fast (about 1.1 / 2.0 / 2.3 s at 20 / 85 / 150 m), the
  // widest splash, few rounds, long reload. Damage 8 a hit: a Light (11.8)
  // or Medium (14) tank in two direct hits, a Heavy (21) in three. Drawn as
  // a small rocket mesh along its flight (nose first, pitching over on the
  // arc) with an exhaust glow at the tail and a smoke trail.
  ProjectileDef(
    name: "MortarProjectile",
    velocity: 75,
    inherit_velocity: 0,
    bounces: 0,
    blast_radius: 8,
    rounds: 12,
    keep_previous_weapon: 1,
    can_be_kept: 0,
    reload_ms: 250,
    volley_delay_ms: 1500,
    volley_size: 3,
    sync_ms: 1000,
    sync_lead_ms: 500,
